Examples: `countDoubles("aaaababaa")` returns 4 and `longestRun("aaaababaa")` returns 4; `countDoubles("baabbabbaa")` returns 4 and `longestRun("baabbabbaa")` returns 2; `countDoubles("abbbaaa")` returns 4 and `longestRun("abbbaaa")` returns 3.

